developer-promised-to-transform-poppleton-into-a-new-urban-district-20-years-later-residents-face-a-failed-redevelopment-and-a-supreme-court-refusal-to-hear-their-case/articleshow/135730792.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2006-a-baltimore-developer-promised-to-transform-poppleton-into-a-new-urban-district-20-years-later-residents-face-a-failed-redevelopment-and-a-supreme-court-refusal-to-hear-their-case/articleshow/135730792.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-14T14:59:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135730839,imgsize-1316666.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Danny Williams donates 185 acres to protect rare lichens in Newfoundland reserve]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135767978.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/former-canadian-premier-danny-williams-donated-185-acres-of-family-land-to-protect-rare-lichens-the-gift-expands-a-newfoundland-nature-reserve-to-1198-acres/articleshow/135767978.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/former-canadian-premier-danny-williams-donated-185-acres-of-family-land-to-protect-rare-lichens-the-gift-expands-a-newfoundland-nature-reserve-to-1198-acres/articleshow/135767978.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-14T14:59:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135768277,imgsize-1317352.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[US flight chaos in photos: Long queues, crowded terminals and thousands of passengers in limbo]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135824081.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/us-flight-chaos-in-photos-long-queues-crowded-terminals-and-thousands-of-passengers-in-limbo/photostory/135824081.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/us-flight-chaos-in-photos-long-queues-crowded-terminals-and-thousands-of-passengers-in-limbo/photostory/135824081.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-14T13:45:38+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Mahima Sharma</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135824081,imgsize-70226.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Australian mechanic honoured for gifting 19 cars to needy youth after son's death]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135823547.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[After the devastating loss of his eldest son, Gavin Hynam launched the Cars 4 Youth initiative. This program supplies refurbished cars to disadvantaged young people in regional Victoria and includes mentorship for aspiring drivers. Through these efforts, Hynam has empowered many youths to chase educational and employment aspirations, leading to him being honored as Victoria's Local Hero for 2027.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/after-losing-his-eldest-son-in-a-2008-accident-australian-mechanic-gavin-hynam-began-restoring-old-cars-for-young-people-in-need-he-had-donated-at-least-19-cars-by-2025-and-has-now-received-a-state-honour/articleshow/135823547.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/after-losing-his-eldest-son-in-a-2008-accident-australian-mechanic-gavin-hynam-began-restoring-old-cars-for-young-people-in-need-he-had-donated-at-least-19-cars-by-2025-and-has-now-received-a-state-honour/articleshow/135823547.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-14T13:59:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135823624,imgsize-810557.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[JD Vance weighs skipping 2028 presidential race after Republican midterm losses: Report]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135825647.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[JD Vance is considering not running for the 2028 presidential election after Republican losses in the midterms. The ongoing Iran conflict and internal party divisions are major factors in his deliberations. His supporters remain divided on whether he will enter the race despite potential competition emerging within the party. Vance’s relationship with Donald Trump also remains uncertain regarding future support.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/jd-vance-weighs-skipping-2028-presidential-race-after-republican-midterm-losses-report/articleshow/135825647.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/jd-vance-weighs-skipping-2028-presidential-race-after-republican-midterm-losses-report/articleshow/135825647.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-14T12:55:02+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Yashasvi Vasistha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135826166,imgsize-65928.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Michigan Dad Pauses Fundraiser: viral prank target stops at $784,273; urges gifts to others]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135754720.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Walter Zerod, a delivery worker who faced a shocking prank at work, found unexpected financial relief through a GoFundMe campaign that skyrocketed to nearly $785,000. This overwhelming support not only helped him but also highlighted the kindness of strangers. In a selfless move, Zerod chose to pause further donations, encouraging his supporters to extend their generosity to other families in financial hardship, demonstrating his deep appreciation and desire for privacy.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-michigan-dad-who-delivers-frozen-pizzas-was-mocked-by-a-prankster-strangers-donated-784000-to-help-his-family-and-then-he-asked-them-to-stop-and-give-to-other-families-and-charities-instead/articleshow/135754720.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-michigan-dad-who-delivers-frozen-pizzas-was-mocked-by-a-prankster-strangers-donated-784000-to-help-his-family-and-then-he-asked-them-to-stop-and-give-to-other-families-and-charities-instead/articleshow/135754720.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-14T12:55:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135754755,imgsize-1010816.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Mary Engle Pennington: The woman who transformed America's food safety standards]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135678960.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/meet-mary-engle-pennington-denied-a-university-degree-because-she-was-a-woman-who-went-on-to-transform-americas-food-safety-standards-and-revolutionise-the-refrigeration-of-milk-eggs-and-meat-/articleshow/135678960.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/meet-mary-engle-pennington-denied-a-university-degree-because-she-was-a-woman-who-went-on-to-transform-americas-food-safety-standards-and-revolutionise-the-refrige