dition of artistic appreciation, which is evident in King Charles III's interests.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/at-13-prince-george-is-following-in-king-charless-artistic-footsteps-his-colourful-kingfisher-drawing-created-at-home-in-windsor-has-now-been-unveiled-in-prince-williams-magazine/articleshow/135824092.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/at-13-prince-george-is-following-in-king-charless-artistic-footsteps-his-colourful-kingfisher-drawing-created-at-home-in-windsor-has-now-been-unveiled-in-prince-williams-magazine/articleshow/135824092.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-14T12:04:00+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135824186,imgsize-96193.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Measure M Sales Tax Hike: San Clemente voters reject beach‑wildfire levy; officials hunt new funds]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135726847.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[The additional revenue was expected to support two dedicated funds over a 10-year period, with half allocated to beach protection and the remaining half directed towards wildfire preparedness. The measure was defeated despite growing concerns about the city's shrinking coastline and the repeated disruption of passenger and freight rail services along the coastal corridor.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-california-beach-town-facing-disappearing-sand-and-repeated-disruption-to-a-coastal-railway-voted-down-a-proposed-tax-that-could-have-raised-15-million-a-year-leaving-officials-to-find-another-way-to-fund-repairs/articleshow/135726847.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-california-beach-town-facing-disappearing-sand-and-repeated-disruption-to-a-coastal-railway-voted-down-a-proposed-tax-that-could-have-raised-15-million-a-year-leaving-officials-to-find-another-way-to-fund-repairs/articleshow/135726847.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-14T12:02:25+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135726859,imgsize-1861716.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Teenage co-founder Anthony Woo diverted 300,000+ pounds of food waste]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135711341.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/meet-anthony-woo-the-teenage-co-founder-of-torus-a-free-curbside-composting-service-in-new-jersey-that-has-diverted-more-than-300000-pounds-of-food-waste-from-landfills/articleshow/135711341.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/meet-anthony-woo-the-teenage-co-founder-of-torus-a-free-curbside-composting-service-in-new-jersey-that-has-diverted-more-than-300000-pounds-of-food-waste-from-landfills/articleshow/135711341.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-14T12:02:18+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135711443,imgsize-1498849.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Sheikh Hasina's return to Bangladesh: India wants Dhaka to fulfil two conditions]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135824475.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[India is reportedly seeking Sheikh Hasina’s return to Bangladesh after more than two years in exile, but has set two conditions for Tarique Rahman’s government. According to BBC Bangla, New Delhi wants the Bangladesh army to fly Hasina back and guarantee her an opportunity to appeal her death sentence and face a fresh trial over the July 2024 crackdown.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/south-asia/sheikh-hasinas-return-to-bangladesh-india-wants-dhaka-to-fulfil-two-conditions-says-report/articleshow/135824475.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/south-asia/sheikh-hasinas-return-to-bangladesh-india-wants-dhaka-to-fulfil-two-conditions-says-report/articleshow/135824475.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-14T11:59:02+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Abhishek Mishra</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135824969,imgsize-1274059.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Texas law professor, 73, survives after Navy SEAL student performs CPR]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135822693.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-73-year-old-texas-law-professor-collapsed-during-class-and-stopped-breathing-a-navy-seal-veteran-in-his-classroom-performed-three-rounds-of-cpr-and-the-professor-has-now-returned-to-teaching-after-surviving/articleshow/135822693.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-73-year-old-texas-law-professor-collapsed-during-class-and-stopped-breathing-a-navy-seal-veteran-in-his-classroom-performed-three-rounds-of-cpr-and-the-professor-has-now-returned-to-teaching-after-surviving/articleshow/135822693.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-14T11:00:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135822817,imgsize-440938.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Mick Jagger’s 50-acre French estate has a Rolling Stones recording studio]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135683777.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/news/mick-jagger-bought-an-18th-century-french-chateau-for-about-477000-in-1980-its-50-acre-estate-has-a-recording-studio-used-by-the-rolling-stones/articleshow/135683777.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/news/mick-jagger-bought-an-18th-century-french-chateau-for-about-477000-in-1980-its-50-acre-estate-has-a-recording-studio-used-by-the-rolling-stones/articleshow/135683777.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-14T11:00:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Lifestyle Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135683833,imgsize-85936.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Nuclear Arms On Agenda: Trump plans reductions with Putin and Xi; officials expect no deal]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135822661.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[US President Donald Trump will attend a trilateral meeting with Vladimir Putin and Xi Jinping in China next week. He aims to raise the issue of global nuclear disarmament during the discussions, emphasizing the dangers of weapons proliferation. The meeting, which takes place during the Asia-Pacific Economic Cooperation forum, may not lead to immediate agreements. Additionally, discussions will likely include the US-Israeli stance on Iran, but Ukraine conflicts are excluded.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/trump-putin-and-xi-to-hold-unprecedented-trilateral-meet-whats-on-agenda/articleshow/135822661.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/trump-putin-and-xi-to-hold-unprecedented-trilateral-meet-whats-on-agenda/articleshow/135822661.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-14T10:06:54+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Mahima Sharma</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135822920,imgsize-97322.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Historic New Jersey theatre reopens after $130 million restoration]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135740042.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Loew’s Jersey Theatre has joyfully reopened its doors after a thorough restoration process that spanned several years. Kicking off its first major event, the esteemed venue will host the Trey Anastasio Band on November 13. The excitement doesn't stop there—on December 2, a community concert will take place, followed by electrifying performances from The War on Drugs and Jodeci later in the month.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-new-jersey-theatre-nearly-faced-demolition-in-the-1980s-but-volunteers-refused-to-abandon-it-after-a-130-million-restoration-the-1929-landmark-has-reopened-ahead-of-its-first-concert-on-13-november/articleshow/135740042.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-new-jersey-theatre-nearly-faced-demolition-in-the-1980s-but-volunteers-refused-to-abandon-it-after-a-130-million-restoration-the-1929-landmark-has-reopened-ahead-of-its-first-concert-on-13-november/articleshow/135740042.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-14T09:59:06+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135740131,imgsize-289716.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Willie Nelson's Farm Aid raises over $90 million for US farmers in 41 years since 1985 launch]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135578165.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Farm Aid, initiated in 1985 by icons like Willie Nelson, Neil Young, and John Mellencamp, has evolved into a cherished annual gathering. The 2026 edition drew a crowd of 14,000, while millions more tuned in via various media. This event not only raised crucial funds but also educated the public about the pressing issues facing family farmers.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-1985-willie-nelson-joined-two-musicians-to-launch-farm-aid-as-us-family-farms-struggled-41-years-later-the-annual-concerts-and-wider-campaign-have-raised-over-90-million-to-support-farmers-and-rural-communities/articleshow/135578165.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-1985-willie-nelson-joined-two-musicians-to-launch-farm-aid-as-us-family-farms-struggled-41-years-later-the-annual-concerts-and-wider-campaign-have-raised-over-90-million-to-support-farmers-and-rural-communities/articleshow/135578165.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-14T09:59:19+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135578552,imgsize-71176.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Marilyn Monroe’s hidden letters and belongings emerge after six decades]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135763859.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/marilyn-monroes-never-before-seen-letters-and-personal-belongings-emerge-from-a-friends-estate-after-60-years-including-notes-on-arthur-miller-joe-dimaggio-and-her-private-struggles/articleshow/135763859.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/marilyn-monroes-never-before-seen-letters-and-personal-belongings-emerge-from-a-friends-estate-after-60-years-incl